  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Tear Open Reality" id="978e-aa39-2176-9390" hidden="false">
      <description>Objective markers you control can become Rifts into Gatespace. 


During the deploy armies step before any player has deployed any units, open a Rift on one Objective marker in your deployment zone. This Rift cannot be closed even if you do not control the objective in your deployment zone. Note: If that Objective marker is destroyed for any reason then that Rift is considered to have closed and is removed from the objective.
At the start the Strategy step, choose one Objective marker you control which does not have a Rift, and open a Rift on it. If you lose control of an Objective marker which has a Rift, that Rift is considered to have closed and is removed from the Objective marker.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
